   "source": [
    "## 3. Clean the missing values\n",
    "\n",
    "Four columns have missing values, and they are not all the same kind of \"missing\":\n",
    "\n",
    "- `Churn Category` and `Churn Reason` are only filled for customers who left. That is expected, and these columns will not be used to predict anything.\n",
    "- `Offer` and `Internet Type` are empty for a reason: no offer was taken, or the customer has no internet service. Let us check the second one, then replace the blanks with explicit words."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "id": "e0d6470b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Internet Type     False  True \n",
      "Internet Service              \n",
      "No                    0   1526\n",
      "Yes                5517      0\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "print(pd.crosstab(df[\"Internet Service\"], df[\"Internet Type\"].isna()))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 7,
   "id": "f99b35c4",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Offer            0\n",
      "Internet Type    0\n",
      "dtype: int64\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "df[\"Offer\"] = df[\"Offer\"].fillna(\"No offer\")\n",
    "df[\"Internet Type\"] = df[\"Internet Type\"].fillna(\"No internet\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(df[[\"Offer\", \"Internet Type\"]].isnull().sum())"
   ]
  },
