   "source": [
    "Raising the threshold flags fewer customers: we are more often right (precision goes up) but we miss more leavers (recall goes down). The right balance depends on **money**.\n",
    "\n",
    "**A simple cost model** (assumptions, not real data):\n",
    "\n",
    "- a retention offer costs **100 €** per customer contacted;\n",
    "- **30%** of the leavers we contact accept to stay;\n",
    "- a customer we keep is worth **12 months of revenue** (the average monthly charge x 12).\n",
    "\n",
    "Expected profit = (leavers caught x success rate x customer value) - (customers contacted x offer cost).\n",
    "\n",
    "A customer is worth contacting when `probability x success rate x value > offer cost`, that is above the **break-even threshold** `offer cost / (success rate x value)`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 21,
   "id": "c95f4946",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Customer value (12 months of revenue): 802\n",
      "Break-even threshold: 0.42\n",
      "Best threshold: 0.45 | profit: 65080\n",
      "Profit at 0.50: 62385\n",
      "Contact nobody: 0\n",
      "Contact everyone: -234562\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "offer_cost = 100\n",
    "success_rate = 0.30\n",
    "customer_value = float(X_train[\"Monthly Charge\"].mean() * 12)\n",
    "break_even = offer_cost / (success_rate * customer_value)\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "def profit_at(probabilities, truth, threshold):\n",
    "    flagged = probabilities >= threshold\n",
    "    caught = (flagged & (truth.values == 1)).sum()\n",
    "    return caught * success_rate * customer_value - flagged.sum() * offer_cost\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "thresholds = np.arange(0.05, 0.96, 0.05)\n",
    "profits = [profit_at(proba, y_train, t) for t in thresholds]\n",
    "\n",
    "best = int(np.argmax(profits))\n",
    "chosen_threshold = round(float(thresholds[best]), 2)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Customer value (12 months of revenue):\", round(customer_value))\n",
    "print(\"Break-even threshold:\", round(break_even, 2))\n",
    "print(\"Best threshold:\", chosen_threshold, \"| profit:\", round(profits[best]))\n",
    "print(\"Profit at 0.50:\", round(profit_at(proba, y_train, 0.50)))\n",
    "print(\"Contact nobody:\", 0)\n",
    "print(\"Contact everyone:\", round(profit_at(proba, y_train, 0.0)))"
   ]
  },
